  "note": "Edge-authored. Builds a shareable one-file review page (application-portal look) where reviewers leave notes per question and a general note, and send them back as text that scripts/parse_notes.py reads. Before that, roasts each YC or a16z Speedrun answer against a rubric of public, attributed partner advice (Garry Tan, Dalton Caldwell, Michael Seibel, Kevin Hale, a16z Speedrun partners, Troy Kirwin's teardown). Optional: tracked private links via the Edge review service.",
